  "html": "\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"750\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"80\"><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr:80/skill/Image/skill_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"500\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" usemap=\"#skill_1\" width=\"80\"></p></td>\n<td nowrap=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"670\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움체\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://www.forg.co.kr:80/skill/Image/t_me.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"28\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"142\"></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp; </font>\n</p><table border=\"\" bordercolor=\"silver\" bordercolordark=\"silver\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"28\" width=\"550\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"top\" height=\"28\" width=\"550\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">메디테이션은 동양적 의미로 명상으로서 \n                        기를 충전 시킨다고</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">할 수 있습니다. 일단 메디가 \n                        성공적으로 발동이 되면</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">마나(mana)가 차는 속도가 현저히 \n                        빠르게 올라갑니다</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">물론 메디 발동을 안하고도 스킬이 \n                        높으면 높을수록</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">마나가 차는 속도가 빠르게 됩니다.</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">메디의 몇가지 제약점에서 명상시 \n                        가만히 서있어야 하고</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">일체의 움직임이나 공격을 받거나 \n                        쇠붙이로된 아머를 입고 있으면</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">안됩니다.메디테이션의 스킬향상은 \n                        마나가 소비됐을시에</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">오르게 된다는 점을 유의하시길 \n                        바랍니다.</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"blue\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><b>:::</b></font><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">마법위주의 플레이어의 경우 메저리,이벨,메디테이션의</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\">3박자를 맞추셔야 한다는 점을 상기하시길</font><font color=\"blue\" face=\"바탕체\" size=\"2\"><b>:::</b></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;\">&nbsp;</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"74\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n<td width=\"676\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움체\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p><map name=\"skill_1\">\n<area coords=\"0, 32, 80, 44\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/ar.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 46, 79, 58\" href=\"/site/skill/mac/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 60, 79, 73\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/sw.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 75, 79, 90\" href=\"/site/skill/fe/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 92, 78, 106\" href=\"/site/skill/wr/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 108, 77, 120\" href=\"/site/skill/an/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 122, 79, 135\" href=\"/site/skill/he/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 182, 79, 196\" href=\"/site/skill/ma/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 198, 79, 211\" href=\"/site/skill/mad/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 213, 79, 226\" href=\"/site/skill/re/\" shape=\"rect\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 286, 79, 301\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/ta.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 303, 79, 315\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/bl.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 317, 79, 330\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/mi.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 332, 79, 346\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/ca.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 348, 79, 361\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/bo.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"1, 363, 79, 375\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/al.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 377, 79, 390\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/skill/po.htm\" shape=\"rect\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<area coords=\"0, 392, 79, 405\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20010128182100/http://www.forg.co.kr/